# The trust root for web bundles. PUBLIC KEYS ONLY.
#
# OpenSSH allowed_signers format. A host verifies a bundle against this file
# and nothing else (`ssh-keygen -Y verify`, through scripts/lib/web-bundle.ts).
# Every line is scoped to the web-bundle namespace, so a key listed here
# verifies web bundles and nothing else.
#
# ROTATION. This file belongs to the platform release a host runs. A web
# release never sends or changes it. Adding, replacing or removing a key is a
# platform release (docs/technical/web-serving-architecture.md §3.1).
#
# THE CONTROL MACHINE'S KEY (release v0.9.0, owner decision 2026-11-15). The
# one line below is the public half of the control machine's bundle key
# (~/.ssh/robotmoney-web-bundle there, the path scripts/release/web-release.ts
# signs with). It replaced the bootstrap entry, whose private half was
# discarded when this file was created, so no bundle could ever verify against
# it; keeping it would only widen the trust root by a key nobody holds.
#
# NEVER a private key. scripts/tests/unit/web-bundle.test.ts reads this file on
# every PR to say so.

web-bundle@robotmoney namespaces="robotmoney-web-bundle@v1" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIBAd48xt0TqAqH1UNYZLLgxqTrlfFadmu+phiOjhav46
